# Harness

- Canonical rules: `AGENTS.md` (keep short; earn each line), `CLAUDE.md` always under 200 lines. Lean is Best.
- Before finishing changes to `src/li_sim/` or `data/`: run `./harness/hooks/validate.sh`.
- Repeatable agent failures → add eval in `harness/evals/` or rule in `AGENTS.md`.
- Subagent specs live in `harness/agents/` — use the narrowest role.
- MCP specs are plans in `harness/mcp/` until implemented.
